project. The logo is the original Jamal Craft artwork supplied with the build.


5. Privacy
----------
The LAN server does not contact any external service. It logs the connecting
IP and request path to its own console for debugging. Game worlds, settings and
the selected username live in the browser's IndexedDB/localStorage for the page
origin; they never leave the device unless the player exports them. There is no
analytics, telemetry, account system or cloud storage in this build.


